'''R6 astromech droids'''<ref name="By the numbers" /> also known as the '''R6-series'''<ref name="SWCT">{{SWCT|set=R-Series|cardname=R0-4L0}}</ref> were a series of [[astromech droid]]s.<ref name="By the numbers" /> Much like the [[R5 series astromech droid|R5]] series,<ref name="Visual Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> the R6's head was shaped like a conical frustum, but its eye piece more closely resembled<ref name="Hasbro">{{HasbroCite|set=Star Wars: Droid Factory (toy line)|pack=''The Rise of Skywalker'' set|altlink=https://www.shopdisney.com/star-wars-the-rise-of-skywalker-droid-factory-figure-set-400911413423.html}}</ref> that of the [[R2-series astromech droid|R2]] series.<ref name="CVD">''[[Star Wars: The Complete Visual Dictionary, New Edition]]''</ref>

During the competitive sporting show [[Hunters of the Outer Rim]]<ref name="SWH">''[[Star Wars: Hunters]]''</ref> in [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Hunters Date">{{HuntersDate}}</ref> the R6 series was used in the combat game [[Power Control]].<ref name="SWH" />

The R6 series was used by the [[Resistance]] in [[starfighter]]s such as the [[T-70 X-wing starfighter|T-70 X-wing]].<ref name="By the numbers" />

